                                "sense_id": "22e86d3a-10cd-3db2-9cf7-cb8c532e65bb",
                                "text": "Indeed, this is one of the best ways to uninfluence people and lose friends."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "924497b7-8cbb-4bd0-8c98-2378c70f3f29",
                                "sense_id": "22e86d3a-10cd-3db2-9cf7-cb8c532e65bb",
                                "text": "U.S. advertising agencies and businessmen were criticized last Tuesday (Feb. 10) for helping to \"uninfluence people\" in Europe and around the world, and for fostering the alienation people in other lands have for the U.S."
                            }
